window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>The explosive finale of The Cloister series. </b></p> <p>Trapped. <br> Beaten. <br> Broken. </p> <p>Adam destroyed himself to save me. At first, I doubt if I have the strength to go on. But with every second that passes, I seethe and curse the Prophet. My time as a Maiden is over. I refuse to be a toy in his game any longer. But there’s always more ways for the Prophet to get to me, to use me, and to keep me under his influence. Will I be strong enough to break free?</p>"; 
